      "title": "Bundler Architecture",
      "items": [
        "Modular source fragments in src/ (00_config through 99_main) compiled by build.sh into standalone antigravity-manager.sh",
        "Zero mandatory dependencies: embeds pure POSIX shell logic and downloads ephemeral Gum TUI to temporary storage",
        "102 automated phase gates validate shell safety, argument routing, and cross-platform installation logic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
